      "text": "Freight term of the day: VGM, verified gross mass.\n\nThe certified weight of a packed container: cargo, packing and the box. Under SOLAS the shipper declares it before loading, or the container doesn't go on the ship.\n\nMiss the cut-off and the box rolls. https://t.co/AGjX9UAbDz",
